Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `wire` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/ws_conn_holder_is_not_copied.jet:19:17
    |
 19 |     Child{wire: wire}
    |                 ^^^^
 Why: `wire` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value, and `Wire` can't be copied into the struct literal
 Fix: Declare the parameter `wire: &&Wire` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `self` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/ws_conn_holder_is_not_copied.jet:10:21
    |
 10 |         Child{wire: self}
    |                     ^^^^
 Why: `self` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value, and `Wire` can't be copied into the struct literal
 Fix: Declare the parameter `self: &&Wire` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
